{"sha": "2e147ee4c1b76020493c668bc2c30821beead6be658e7b5ead6553a7b43c42e3", "body": ["\\begin{proposition}[浓差电池的电压]\\label{prop:b2:cell-thermodynamics:concentration-cell}", "金属 M 的两个电极分别浸入 \\ce{M^{n+}} 的溶液中，其浓度分别为", "$c_1 < c_2$，经盐桥相连，得到电压", "\\[", "  U = \\frac{RT}{nF}\\ln\\frac{c_2}{c_1} ,", "\\]", "浓度较大的一侧为正极。电池工作直至", "两侧浓度相等为止。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "由能斯特方程，每个电极的电势为 $E_i = E^\\circ + (RT/nF)\\ln c_i$（理想", "稀溶液）；$E^\\circ$ 在作差时抵消。反应为", "\\ce{M^{n+}}（2 侧）$\\to$ \\ce{M^{n+}}（1 侧）：金属在浓度较大的一侧沉积", "（阴极），在浓度较小的一侧溶解（阳极），这使两侧浓度趋于一致；", "$\\Delta_r G = RT\\ln(c_1/c_2) < 0$，直至", "两侧浓度相等。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, >={Stealth}]", "  \\pic at (0,0) {beaker={0.7}{omDef!10}};", "  \\pic at (3.6,0) {beaker={0.7}{omDef!32}};", "  \\pic at (-0.3,0.25) {electrode={black!25}};", "  \\pic at (3.9,0.25) {electrode={black!25}};", "  \\pic at (0.35,0.55) {saltbridge={2.9}};", "  \\pic (m) at (1.8,4.3) {meter={V}};", "  % common (black) terminal on the anode side, red (+) on the cathode side", "  \\fill[black] (1.4,4.03) circle (0.065); \\fill[red!70!black] (2.2,4.03) circle (0.065);", "  \\draw[thick] (-0.15,2.65) |- (m-a);", "  \\draw[thick] (4.05,2.65) |- (m-b);", "  \\node[anchor=east] at (-0.95,1.0) {\\ce{Ag}};", "  \\node[anchor=west] at (4.45,1.0) {\\ce{Ag}};", "  \\node at (0.25,-0.35) {\\ce{Ag+} \\qty{0.010}{mol/L}};", "  \\node at (3.6,-0.35) {\\ce{Ag+} \\qty{0.10}{mol/L}};", "  \\node[anchor=east] at (-0.9,2.3) {$-$ 阳极};", "  \\node[anchor=west] at (4.6,2.3) {阴极 $+$};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (-0.1,-0.8) {\\ce{Ag -> Ag+ + e-}};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (3.7,-0.8) {\\ce{Ag+ + e- -> Ag}};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (1.8,5.05) {$U = \\qty{59}{mV}$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 银浓差电池，温度为 \\qty{25}{\\degreeCelsius}。浓度较小的一侧为", "阳极，银在该侧溶解，并在浓度较大的一侧沉积，", "直至两侧浓度相等。$U = 0.0592\\log(0.10/0.010) =", "\\qty{59}{mV}$。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "同一原理也可用于测定浓度。玻璃电极的薄膜", "将参比溶液与待测样品隔开，产生膜电势", "$(RT/F)\\ln 10 = \\qty{59}{mV}$，每单位 pH 差在", "\\qty{25}{\\degreeCelsius} 下，本科一年级分册中的 pH 计，实为针对", "\\ce{H+} 的浓差电池。活细胞膜两侧，不等的", "\\ce{K+} 浓度同样产生数十毫伏的电势。", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:cell-thermodynamics:1}", "已知 $\\Delta_f G^\\circ(\\ce{H2O}, \\text{l}) = \\qty{-237.14}{kJ/mol}$，求", "氢氧电池的标准电压。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:cell-thermodynamics:2}", "电池额定容量为 \\qty{1.0}{A.h}。求其所储存的电荷量（以库仑计）", "，以及电池完全放电时阳极（\\ce{Zn -> Zn^2+ + 2e-}）", "上消耗的锌的质量。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:cell-thermodynamics:3}", "丹尼尔电池在无电流时输出 \\qty{1.10}{V}。求 $\\Delta_r G$（对应", "1 摩尔锌），以及 \\qty{10.0}{g} 锌的最大电功。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:cell-thermodynamics:4}", "两根铜电极分别浸入浓度为 \\qty{1.0e-3}{mol/L}", "和 \\qty{0.10}{mol/L} 的硫酸铜溶液中。求 \\qty{25}{\\degreeCelsius} 时的电压，并", "指出正极与负极。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:cell-thermodynamics:5}", "某电池（$n = 2$）的 $E^\\circ = \\qty{1.015}{V}$，$dE^\\circ/dT = \\qty{-4.0e-4}{V/K}$，", "在 \\qty{298}{K} 下（习题数据）。求 $\\Delta_r G^\\circ$、$\\Delta_r S^\\circ$ 和", "$\\Delta_r H^\\circ$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:cell-thermodynamics:6}", "\\cref{exo:b2:cell-thermodynamics:5}中的电池放电，进行 1 摩尔反应：", "（a）可逆地；（b）在 \\qty{0.90}{V} 下。求两种情形下的电功", "及与外界交换的热量。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:cell-thermodynamics:7}", "由生成吉布斯自由能，求 $E^\\circ(\\ce{Fe^3+}/\\ce{Fe})$，", "（\\ce{Fe^2+} \\qty{-78.90}{kJ/mol}，\\ce{Fe^3+} \\qty{-4.7}{kJ/mol}），并验证它", "等于 $(E_1^\\circ + 2E_2^\\circ)/3$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:cell-thermodynamics:8}", "求电对 \\ce{AgCl}/\\ce{Ag} 的标准电极电势，再求", "氯化银电极浸入 \\qty{0.10}{mol/L} 的", "氯化钾溶液中时的电极电势。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:cell-thermodynamics:9}", "锌--空气电池采用反应 \\ce{2Zn + O2 -> 2ZnO}（$\\Delta_f G^\\circ(\\ce{ZnO}) =", "\\qty{-318.30}{kJ/mol}$）。求标准电压，以及", "每千克锌的最大电能（以 \\unit{kW.h} 计）。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:cell-thermodynamics:10}", "直接甲醇燃料电池进行反应 \\ce{CH3OH(l) + 3/2O2 -> CO2 + 2H2O(l)}。已知", "$\\Delta_f H^\\circ$（\\unit{kJ/mol}）：\\ce{CH3OH(l)} $-239$，\\ce{CO2} $-393.51$，", "\\ce{H2O(l)} $-285.83$；以及 $S^\\circ$（\\unit{J/(K.mol)}）：\\ce{CH3OH(l)} 127.2，", "\\ce{CO2} 213.8，\\ce{H2O(l)} 69.95，\\ce{O2} 205.15，求 $n$、$E^\\circ$ 和", "最大效率。", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}